  "When you are ready to start this activity, click on the begin button. When you get your 5th correct answer, you will get a certificate that you can share with your teacher letting your teacher know how you did.": "准备好后，点击“开始”按钮即可开始本活动。答对 5 题后会获得一张证书，可以分享给老师，让老师看到你的表现。",
  "When you are ready to start this activity, click on the begin button. When you get your 10th correct answer, you will get a certificate that you can share with your teacher letting your teacher know how you did.": "准备好后，点击“开始”按钮即可开始本活动。答对 10 题后会获得一张证书，可以分享给老师，让老师看到你的表现。",
  "When you get your 5th correct answer, you will get a certificate that you can share with your teacher letting your teacher know how you did": "答对 5 题后会获得一张证书，可以分享给老师，让老师看到你的表现",
  "When you are ready to start the challenge, click on the Begin button. You need a score of 10 to obtain your completion certificate.": "准备好后，点击“开始”按钮即可开始挑战。需要得到 10 分才能获得完成证书。",
  "When you are ready to start the challenge, click on the Begin button and when you have finished hit End to submit your results.": "准备好后，点击“开始”按钮即可开始挑战，完成后点击“结束”提交结果。",
  "When you are ready to start the problem, click on the Begin button and when you have worked out your answers hit End to submit your results.": "准备好后，点击“开始”按钮即可开始本题，想好答案后点击“结束”提交结果。",
  "When you are ready to start the problem, click on the Begin button and when you have finished hit End to submit your results.": "准备好后，点击“开始”按钮即可开始本题，完成后点击“结束”提交结果。",
  "When you are ready to start this activity, click on the begin button. When finished with the online version, you should redo the steps with real equipment.": "准备好后，点击“开始”按钮即可开始本活动。完成在线版本后，请用真实器材再按步骤做一遍。",
  "If you select touch version, you must touch and release the gas pedal or the brake pedal to activate and touch and release the pedal again to deactivate.": "如果选择触屏版，需要按住并松开油门或刹车踏板来激活，再按住并松开一次来取消。",
  "If you select desktop version, you must click on hold the gas pedal and/or the brake pedal to control the car.": "如果选择电脑版，需要按住油门和/或刹车踏板来控制小车。",
  "Once you have determined the relationships, you will be making predictions based on your results.": "确定关系之后，你就可以根据结果作出预测。",
  "Once you develop your equation, you will use it to make predictions on things you didn't measure.": "写出公式之后，你就可以用它预测没有测量过的事物。",
  "Once you have discovered the relationship, you will use this to make predictions on things you haven't measured.": "发现关系之后，你就可以用它预测没有测量过的事物。",
  "Click on the resistor or battery pack to generate new random voltages or resistances.": "点击电阻或电池组即可生成新的随机电压或电阻值。",
  "After you determine the center of mass, click on its location on the grid.": "确定质心之后，在网格上点击它的位置。",
  "Drag the object (pencil) to observe the position and size of its image.": "拖动物体（铅笔），观察像的位置和大小。",
  "Click on the multimeters to read the voltage or the current.": "点击万用表读取电压或电流。",
  "Do these challenges without the use of a calculator.": "完成这些挑战时不要使用计算器。",
  "The lab will have time slowed down slightly to make the motion more noticeable.": "实验中的时间会略微放慢，让运动更容易观察。",
  "Time has been slowed down so you get a better feel for what is happening": "时间已放慢，便于你更清楚地观察发生了什么",
  "You are a professional driver on a closed 1 km course. Use your gas and brakes to create different motion graphs. Click on the y-axis of the graph to change what is being graphed.": "你是一名在 1 公里封闭赛道上驾驶的职业车手。用油门和刹车画出不同的运动图像，点击图像的 y 轴可以切换所画的量。",
  "Lost boats and boats destroyed by logs will cost you points.": "丢失的小船和被原木撞毁的小船会扣分。",
  "Most of your data should be collected with a third resistor stripe of brown or black": "大多数数据应在第三条色环为棕色或黑色的电阻上采集",
  "Click on the move meter button to switch your meters to another resistor.": "点击换表按钮，把仪表切换到另一个电阻上。",
  "These teams are 100% fictitious and any resemblance to real teams is purely intentional.": "这些队伍完全是虚构的，与任何真实队伍的相似之处纯属刻意。",
  "You will be able to cycle through different values of Resistance, Capacitance, and Voltage": "你可以在不同的电阻、电容与电压取值之间切换",
  "Adjust the initial speed so the cart moves up and then down the inclined track.": "调节初速度，让小车先沿斜坡上行再下行。",
  "Use the amplitude slider to change the starting displacement.": "用振幅滑块改变初始位移。",
  "Use the friction slider to add air resistance and damping.": "用摩擦滑块加入空气阻力与阻尼。",
  "Switch between position, velocity, and acceleration graphs.": "在位置、速度与加速度图像之间切换。",
  "Observe the energy bars and graphs as energy changes during the motion.": "观察运动过程中能量柱与图像的变化。",
