  "Positive direction is away from the motion sensor. You can reverse the positive direction using the Reverse button.": "正方向为远离运动传感器的方向，可用“反向”按钮调换正方向。",
  "The inward net force causes the inward acceleration in uniform circular motion.": "指向圆心的合力引起匀速圆周运动中的向心加速度。",
  "The inward components of real forces provide the centripetal acceleration.": "各个实际力沿半径方向的分量提供向心加速度。",
  "No new force is added. The inward component of the net force causes centripetal acceleration.": "并没有新增的力，是合力的指向圆心分量引起向心加速度。",
  "Do not add a separate “centripetal force” arrow unless it represents the net inward force.": "除非表示合力的指向圆心分量，否则不要另加“向心力”箭头。",
  "Increasing speed increases the required inward force; increasing radius decreases it.": "速度越大，需要的指向圆心的力越大；半径越大，该力越小。",
  "At maximum speed, friction acts down the slope and contributes an inward component.": "在最大速度处，摩擦力沿斜面向下，并提供指向圆心的分量。",
  "A beam is in rotational equilibrium when the sum of all torques about its pivot is zero.": "当梁对支点的所有力矩之和为零时，梁处于转动平衡。",
  "Use the \"Pause\" button to observe the positive or negative signs of velocity and acceleration.": "用“暂停”按钮观察速度与加速度的正负号。",
  "The maximum speed depends on the curve radius, bank angle, gravitational acceleration, and coefficient of friction.": "最大速度取决于弯道半径、倾角、重力加速度和摩擦系数。",
  "The normal force is perpendicular to the banked road surface and has both vertical and inward components.": "支持力垂直于倾斜路面，同时具有竖直分量和指向圆心的分量。",
  "Friction opposes motion. As friction increases, the net force decreases, leading to a smaller acceleration.": "摩擦阻碍运动。摩擦增大时合力减小，加速度随之变小。",
  "When the mass of the cart increases, the acceleration decreases for the same pulling force. A larger total mass makes the": "小车质量增大时，同样的拉力产生的加速度变小。总质量越大，",
  "A pulley is a simple machine made of a wheel and a rope or cable. It helps lift objects by changing the direction of force.": "滑轮是由轮和绳（或缆）组成的简单机械，它通过改变力的方向来帮助提升物体。",
  "A pulley system can reduce the input force needed to lift an object by distributing the load across multiple supporting": "滑轮组把负载分散到多段绳子上，从而减少提升物体所需的输入力。",
  "A pulley system reduces input force by increasing the distance over which the force is applied. This follows conservation": "滑轮组通过增大施力距离来减小输入力，这符合能量守恒。",
  "In an ideal pulley system, the mechanical advantage is approximately equal to the number of rope segments supporting the": "在理想滑轮组中，机械利益约等于承受负载的绳段数。",
  "A fixed pulley changes the direction of the applied force, but it does not reduce the required input force in an ideal": "定滑轮改变施加力的方向，但在理想情况下并不减少所需的输入力。",
  "A movable pulley allows more than one rope segment to support the load, so each segment carries only part of the weight.": "动滑轮让多段绳共同承受负载，因此每段绳只承担一部分重量。",
  "A movable pulley reduces the input force because the load is supported by more than one rope segment.": "动滑轮减小输入力，因为负载由多段绳共同支撑。",
  "A compound pulley system combines fixed and movable pulleys to increase mechanical advantage and make lifting easier.": "复合滑轮组结合定滑轮与动滑轮，增大机械利益，让提升更省力。",
  "Real pulley systems are not perfectly efficient because of friction, pulley weight, and energy loss. When efficiency is": "真实滑轮组并非完全高效，因为存在摩擦、滑轮自重与能量损失。当效率",
  "Lower efficiency means more input force is required because some energy is lost to friction and pulley motion.": "效率越低，需要的输入力越大，因为一部分能量被摩擦与滑轮运动消耗。",
  "Torque describes the turning effect of a force about a pivot. In the standard sign convention, counterclockwise torque is": "力矩描述力绕支点的转动效果。按标准符号约定，逆时针力矩为",
  "This 3D physics simulation shows how mechanical advantage, efficiency, input force, and weight affect lifting.": "这个三维物理仿真展示机械利益、效率、输入力与负载如何影响提升过程。",
  "Compare the pulling distance with the lifted distance.": "比较拉绳距离与提升距离。",
  "Choose one fixed pulley, one movable pulley, or a compound pulley system.": "选择定滑轮、动滑轮或复合滑轮组。",
  "Increase the input force to lift the object. Compare fixed, movable, and compound pulley systems.": "增大输入力以提升物体，比较定滑轮、动滑轮与复合滑轮组。",
  "Adjust the input force, weight, and efficiency.": "调节输入力、负载与效率。",
  "Note: This simulation assumes an impact time of about 0.15 s, similar to a student stopping the cart by hand, to clearly": "注意：本仿真假设碰撞时间约为 0.15 秒（相当于学生用手挡住小车），以便清晰地",
  "A graph panel displays energy versus time and a phase-space graph of displacement versus velocity. These graphs help students": "图像面板显示能量—时间图像与位移—速度相空间图像，这些图像帮助学生",
  "The phrase “centripetal force” should not be treated as a new force. It means the inward component of the net force. The": "“向心力”这个说法不应被当成一种新的力，它指的是合力的指向圆心分量。",
  "This interactive 3D physics simulation explains circular motion without introducing a false extra force. The simulation": "这个交互式三维物理仿真在不引入假想额外力的情况下讲清圆周运动。仿真",
